<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  /* Basic styling to mimic document structure */
  body { font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif; }
  h1, h2, h3 { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 0.5em; }
  .section-header { font-weight: bold; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .form-row { display: flex; margin-bottom: 15px; align-items: center; }
  .form-row > div { flex: 1; }
  .label { font-weight: normal; }
  .input-line { border-bottom: 1px solid #000; min-width: 100px; }
</style>

<div class="page">
  <header>
    <p>LOUISIANA STATE UNIVERSITY HEALTH SCIENCES CENTER SCHOOL OF DENTISTRY</p>
    <p>Department of Periodontics</p>
    <p>1100 Florida Avenue New Orleans, LA 70119 Phone: <span data-field="phone">{{ phone }}</span> Fax: <span data-field="fax">{{ fax }}</span></p>
  </header>

  <h2 style="text-align: center; margin-top: 30px;">PERIODONTICS EXTERNSHIP APPLICATION</h2>

  <div class="section-header">INSTRUCTIONS:</div>
  <p>Complete Parts I and II of this application and return to Dr. Pooja Maney at above address or fax number or email: <span data-field="email_address">{{ email_address }}</span>. Please note submission of application does not guarantee availability nor acceptance for a periodontics externship through LSU Health Sciences Center School of Dentistry.</p>

  <div class="section-header">PART I: TO BE COMPLETED BY EXTERNSHIP APPLICANT</div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="label" style="width: 150px;">Name:</div>
    <div class="input-line" style="flex: 1;">
      <span data-field="full_name">{{ full_name }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="label" style="width: 150px;">Address:</div>
    <div class="input-line" style="flex: 3;">
      <span data-field="address">{{ address }}</span>
    </div>
    <div class="label" style="width: 100px;">City:</div>
    <div class="input-line" style="flex: 1;">
      <span data-field="city">{{ city }}</span>
    </div>
    <div class="label" style="width: 100px;">State:</div>
    <div class="input-line" style="flex: 1;">
      <span data-field="state">{{ state }}</span>
    </div>
    <div class="label" style="width: 100px;">Zip:</div>
    <div class="input-line" style="flex: 1;">
      <span data-field="zip_code">{{ zip_code }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="label" style="width: 150px;">Phone:</div>
    <div class="input-line" style="flex: 3;">
      <span data-field="phone_number">{{ phone_number }}</span>
    </div>
    <div class="label" style="width: 150px;">Fax:</div>
    <div class="input-line" style="flex: 3;">
      <span data-field="fax_number">{{ fax_number }}</span>
    </div>
    <div class="label" style="width: 150px;">Email:</div>
    <div class="input-line" style="flex: 3;">
      <span data-field="email_address_applicant">{{ email_address_applicant }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="label" style="width: 150px;">Year of Study:</div>
    <div class="input-line" style="flex: 1;">1</div>
    <div class="input-line" style="flex: 1;">2</div>
    <div class="input-line" style="flex: 1;">3</div>
    <div class="input-line" style="flex: 1;">4</div>
    <div class="label" style="width: 150px;">Graduation Year:</div>
    <div class="input-line" style="flex: 3;">
      <span data-field="graduation_year">{{ graduation_year }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="label" style="width: 150px;">Dental School Attending / Attended:</div>
    <div class="input-line" style="flex: 3;">
      <span data-field="dental_school">{{ dental_school }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-header">Requested Dates of Externship (please give up to 3 choices):</div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="label" style="width: 150px;">1. From (month/day/year):</div>
    <div class="input-line" style="flex: 3;">
      <span data-field="requested_date_1_start">{{ requested_date_1_start }}</span>
    </div>
    <div class="label" style="width: 150px;">To (month/day/year):</div>
    <div class="input-line" style="flex: 3;">
      <span data-field="requested_date_1_end">{{ requested_date_1_end }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="label" style="width: 150px;">2. From (month/day/year):</div>
    <div class="input-line" style="flex: 3;">
      <span data-field="requested_date_2_start">{{ requested_date_2_start }}</span>
    </div>
    <div class="label" style="width: 150px;">To (month/day/year):</div>
    <div class="input-line" style="flex: 3;">
      <span data-field="requested_date_2_end">{{ requested_date_2_end }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row">
    <div class="label" style="width: 150px;">3. From (month/day/year):</div>
    <div class="input-line" style="flex: 3;">
      <span data-field="requested_date_3_start">{{ requested_date_3_start }}</span>
    </div>
    <div class="label" style="width: 150px;">To (month/day/year):</div>
    <div class="input-line" style="flex: 3;">
      <span data-field="requested_date_3_end">{{ requested_date_3_end }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-header">ACKNOWLEDGEMENT</div>
  <p>In accepting this externship, I understand the LSU Health Sciences Center and/or School of Dentistry assume no responsibility for professional liability insurance, the cost of travel, living expenses, or health care needs during the time of and traveling to/from the externship. (Please include documentation of health insurance coverage and malpractice coverage)</p>

  <div class="form-row" style="margin-top: 50px;">
    <div class="label" style="width: 150px;">Applicant Signature:</div>
    <div class="input-line" style="flex: 3;" data-field="applicant_signature">{{ applicant_signature }}</div>
    <div class="label" style="width: 150px;">Date:</div>
    <div class="input-line" style="flex: 3;" data-field="date">{{ date }}</div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div class="section-header">PART II: TO BE COMPLETED BY THE OFFICE OF ACADEMIC AFFAIRS / CURRENT EMPLOYER</div>
  <p>The above named applicant is in good standing at the above mentioned dental school / current place of employment and is authorized to participate in an externship at LSUHSC School of Dentistry in the Department of Periodontics.</p>

  <div class="form-row" style="margin-top: 40px;">
    <div class="label" style="width: 150px;">Name:</div>
    <div class="input-line" style="flex: 3;">
      <span data-field="employer_name">{{ employer_name }}</span>
    </div>
    <div class="label" style="width: 150px;">Title:</div>
    <div class="input-line" style="flex: 3;">
      <span data-field="employer_title">{{ employer_title }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row" style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <div class="label" style="width: 150px;">Signature:</div>
    <div class="input-line" style="flex: 3;" data-field="signature">{{ signature }}</div>
    <div class="label" style="width: 150px;">Date:</div>
    <div class="input-line" style="flex: 3;" data-field="date_2">{{ date_2 }}</div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-header" style="margin-top: 50px;">PART III: TO BE COMPLETED BY THE DEPARTMENT OF PERIODONTICS AT LSUHSC</div>
  <p>The above named applicant has been approved for participation in a Periodontics Externship.</p>

  <div class="form-row" style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <div class="label" style="width: 150px;">Beginning date:</div>
    <div class="input-line" style="flex: 3;">
      <span data-field="approval_start_date">{{ approval_start_date }}</span>
    </div>
    <div class="label" style="width: 150px;">Ending date:</div>
    <div class="input-line" style="flex: 3;">
      <span data-field="approval_end_date">{{ approval_end_date }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row" style="margin-top: 40px;">
    <div class="label" style="width: 150px;">Approval: Department Head:</div>
    <div class="input-line" style="flex: 3;">
      <span data-field="department_head_signature">{{ department_head_signature }}</span>
    </div>
    <div class="label" style="width: 150px;">Date:</div>
    <div class="input-line" style="flex: 3;">
      <span data-field="department_head_date">{{ department_head_date }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="form-row" style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <div class="label" style="width: 150px;">Postgrad Director:</div>
    <div class="input-line" style="flex: 3;">
      <span data-field="postgrad_director_signature">{{ postgrad_director_signature }}</span>
    </div>
    <div class="label" style="width: 150px;">Date:</div>
    <div class="input-line" style="flex: 3;">
      <span data-field="postgrad_director_date">{{ postgrad_director_date }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>